  "description": "Robo Kingdom is a large robot-themed play station with two robot-head towers and a third tower under a pointed canopy. Bridges and a net tunnel connect the towers, and tube slides and open slides come down from different levels. Children in the 5 to 12 key user group can climb through the net tunnel, cross between towers and pick a different slide each time. It is finished in Play Orange and Forest Green, which shows as orange with a dark teal in the photos. With its spread of towers, it suits a school ground, a township park or a resort that wants one main play piece. The age group is 5+ and the listed capacity is 15. A 3-year warranty applies to its galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us for a layout drawing showing the footprint and safe play area on your site.",
